Z||000005||Cliff Pennock||12-20-2001||09:23 PM||||Getting the needles off is easy, getting them back on is slightly more difficult. Remember these are aircoils, so there's no "zero" position when there's no power going to them. To get them back on in the proper position, you need to hook up the dash and turn on the ignition. <I>Then</I> put the needles back in the zero position.||||reg||1
