Z||000008||FieroFanaticus2||12-20-2001||10:31 PM||||I just got mine in the mail yesterday from a guy on ebay.  They didn't come cut out, but it's not hard to cut em up.  I've only had a chance to get the one gauge done.  The needle came off a little stiff, but I used a fork to help pry it off, and it just pushed back into place.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PC200010.JPG"> ||||reg||1
